To better define the dependencies, we must ask: **"Which activities are globally synchronized, and which are lane-specific branches that must rejoin before the next communal phase?"** 

Answer: The practice consists of three distinct phases: communal setup (briefing/warm-up/whiteboard/kick), independent main sets (lane-specific durations), and the communal finish (sprint/cooldown/debrief). The critical dependency is that the sprint set (limited by the blocks) and the cooldown (requiring all lanes) cannot start until all three main sets are complete, even if some lanes finish their main set early. We must introduce an inferred `wait-for-lanes` barrier to ensure the synchronization occurs at the end of the main set window.

```json
{
  "schemaVersion": "0.3.0-alpha",
  "programId": "thursday-am-swim",
  "name": "Thursday AM Swim Practice",
  "environmentType": "gym",
  "actors": 1,
  "tracks": [
    {
      "trackId": "coach-lane-mgmt",
      "name": "Coach and Lanes",
      "steps": [
        {
          "stepId": "briefing",
          "name": "Brief the squad",
          "task": "coach",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 300 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "programStart" },
          "metadata": { "sourceSpan": { "quote": "Brief the squad on the pool deck: what the morning is, who is in which lane, 5 minutes.", "occurrence": 1 }, "inferred": false }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "watch-warmup",
          "name": "Watch warm-up",
          "task": "coach",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 900 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "briefing" },
          "metadata": { "sourceSpan": { "quote": "Watch the warm-up from the deck and fix anything ugly; 15 minutes.", "occurrence": 1 }, "inferred": false }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "warmup",
          "name": "Warm-up swim",
          "task": "lanes",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 1200 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "briefing" },
          "metadata": { "sourceSpan": { "quote": "20 minutes, 800 easy, mixed stroke, breathing every five on the last hundred.", "occurrence": 1 }, "inferred": false }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "whiteboard",
          "name": "Walk the main set",
          "task": "coach",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 300 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "warmup" },
          "metadata": { "sourceSpan": { "quote": "walk the main set on the whiteboard; 5 minutes.", "occurrence": 1 }, "inferred": false }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "kick-set",
          "name": "Kick set",
          "task": "lanes",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 1200 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "whiteboard" },
          "metadata": { "sourceSpan": { "quote": "20 minutes of kick, boards for lanes 1 and 2, vertical kick for lane 3", "occurrence": 1 }, "inferred": false }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "main-set-1",
          "name": "Lane 1 Main Set",
          "task": "lanes",
          "duration": { "type": "variable", "minSeconds": 1800, "maxSeconds": 3000, "defaultSeconds": 2400 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "kick-set" },
          "metadata": { "sourceSpan": { "quote": "Lane 1: 30 to 50 minutes, 40 minutes is the plan.", "occurrence": 1 }, "inferred": false }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "main-set-2",
          "name": "Lane 2 Main Set",
          "task": "lanes",
          "duration": { "type": "variable", "minSeconds": 1800, "maxSeconds": 3000, "defaultSeconds": 2700 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "kick-set" },
          "metadata": { "sourceSpan": { "quote": "Lane 2: 30 to 50 minutes, 45 minutes is the plan.", "occurrence": 1 }, "inferred": false }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "main-set-3",
          "name": "Lane 3 Main Set",
          "task": "lanes",
          "duration": { "type": "variable", "minSeconds": 1800, "maxSeconds": 3000, "defaultSeconds": 3000 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "kick-set" },
          "metadata": { "sourceSpan": { "quote": "Lane 3: 30 to 50 minutes, 50 minutes is the plan.", "occurrence": 1 }, "inferred": false }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "wait-for-lanes",
          "name": "Sync Barrier",
          "task": "coach",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 1 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "compound", "logic": "all", "triggers": [{"type": "afterStep", "stepId": "main-set-1"}, {"type": "afterStep", "stepId": "main-set-2"}, {"type": "afterStep", "stepId": "main-set-3"}] },
          "metadata": { "sourceSpan": null, "inferred": true }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "sprint-set",
          "name": "Sprint set",
          "task": "blocks",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 1800 },
          "replicates": { "count": 3, "mode": "serial" },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "wait-for-lanes" },
          "metadata": { "sourceSpan": { "quote": "Time the sprints from the deck: 30 minutes, stopwatch and the wall clock.", "occurrence": 1 }, "inferred": false }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "cooldown",
          "name": "Cooldown",
          "task": "lanes",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 600 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "sprint-set", "instances": "all" },
          "metadata": { "sourceSpan": { "quote": "10 minutes, 300 easy backstroke and breaststroke.", "occurrence": 1 }, "inferred": false }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "debrief",
          "name": "Debrief",
          "task": "coach",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 600 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "cooldown" },
          "metadata": { "sourceSpan": { "quote": "10 minutes on the deck at the end: splits, what to fix, Saturday's meet.", "occurrence": 1 }, "inferred": false }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "resourceConstraints": [
    { "task": "coach", "maxConcurrent": 1 },
    { "task": "lanes", "maxConcurrent": 3 },
    { "task": "blocks", "maxConcurrent": 1 }
  ]
}
```
